                <pb facs="0430" n="414" sameAs="frus:frus1947v04/pg414"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On January 28, the Department of State released to the press a statement,
                    approved in advance by President Truman, setting forth the position of the
                    United States Government on the conduct of the recent Polish general election.
                    For the text of the statement, see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, February 9, 1947, page 251.</p>
            </div>
